<title>CANADA: Canada grain body details canola quality.</title>
<headline>Canada grain body details canola quality.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Grain Commission on Thursday detailed preliminary canola oil and protein content quality for the 1996 harvest.</p>
<p>1996 Harvest  Oil (pct) Protein (pct) Chlorophyll (mg/kg)</p>
<p>Grade Samples Mean Avg  Mean Avg	Mean Avg</p>
<p>Manitoba</p>
<p>No1 C 297     42.1	21.5	    18</p>
<p>No2 C  88     40.9	22.3	    32</p>
<p>No3 C  40     41.1	22.4	    46</p>
<p>Saskathcewan</p>
<p>No1 C 587     43.6	19.8	    16</p>
<p>No2 C 230     42.6	20.3	    29</p>
<p>No3 C  63     41.6	21.0	    45</p>
<p>Alberta</p>
<p>No1 C 582     43.9	19.8	    12</p>
<p>No2 C 133     42.6	21.1	    27</p>
<p>No3 C  21     42.0	21.6	    41</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
